      <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;line-height:1.55;color:#86868E;">
        Earlier Craft &amp; Ship cost comparisons quoted specific numbers: base plans, add-ons, processing rates, contract terms, and export fees. This page is the receipt. Every number traces back to a public source you can verify yourself.
      </p>
