      <!-- What's not verified -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display mb-3" style="font-size:1.5rem;color:#F2EEE5;font-weight:600;">What is not fully verified</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">Uncertain numbers are flagged in this list so you can decide how much weight to give them.</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 pl-5 list-disc" style="color:#86868E;">
          <li><strong style="color:#F2EEE5;">Mindbody data-export fee:</strong> Gymdesk's migration guide cites a paid export on cancellation. Mindbody's TOS confirms additional fees may apply but does not publish the number. We cite Gymdesk as the source, not Mindbody.</li>
          <li><strong style="color:#F2EEE5;">Mindbody Marketing Suite pricing:</strong> aggregator range of $75 to $250 per month, not rate-carded. The comparisons showed a range, not a point estimate.</li>
          <li><strong style="color:#F2EEE5;">Vagaro branded app price:</strong> the public page shows $100 per month, and that is the figure the comparisons used.</li>
          <li><strong style="color:#F2EEE5;">Mindbody Starter floor:</strong> aggregators quote $99, $129, and $139 as "current." The comparisons used $139 as the most-recent 2026 number.</li>
